{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3014","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3014","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3014\",\"parent_revision\":\"48298f961c6d2e52ca8f16dccd408ce913be2400b1def4ddbc8de334dcdddff3\",\"root_revision\":\"48298f961c6d2e52ca8f16dccd408ce913be2400b1def4ddbc8de334dcdddff3\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Chore\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-19\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n.claude/rules/python-development.md was amended (astral plugin migration, node A3) to say config-level [[tool.ty.overrides]] relaxation is allowed only when it cites one of the 4 acceptable-exception categories in .claude/rules/linting-exceptions.md by name in a comment beside the override.\\n\\nAuditing the actual pyproject.toml [[tool.ty.overrides]] blocks (lines 169-216, 4 blocks total) found only 1 of 4 conforms: the SOLID-corpus override (202-208) explicitly cites a linting-exceptions.md category. The other 3 \u2014 agentskill-kaizen, the tests glob, and the pytest.skip-reader-tests override \u2014 instead cite tool-bug/stub-incompleteness reasons that aren't one of the 4 blessed categories.\\n\\nThis is pre-existing drift, not caused by the migration. The new rule text is forward-looking policy; retrofitting the 3 non-conforming overrides with a category citation (or adding a 5th category to linting-exceptions.md if \\\"known upstream tool bug/incomplete stub\\\" deserves to be a blessed category in its own right) is separate follow-up work.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the project infrastructure**, I want to **three of four [[tool.ty.overrides]] blocks don't cite a linting-exceptions.md category** so that **the project infrastructure stays healthy**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Discovered during A3 execution of the astral plugin migration (task-graph node A3)\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-19\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"f2013effb22ae7ac15d05e21ccdd5f1c77eb09b630ed7d0dbfb1cf28b59fa4c5\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPhk25Q\"}"}